  "body": "In https://github.com/WebAudio/web-audio-api/issues/815#issuecomment-220375880, we need the concept of a `Float32Array` that does not contain `{+,-}Infinity` or `NaN`, and throw when this is the case.\n\nFor now we're doing it manually. Asking around, this is currently not supported, is this something we'd be interested in?\n",
